}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "本模块不涉及新增 AI 推理链路。"]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "u001082", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 2, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 2}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 14.5, "szUnit": "pt"}, "M3-用量管理"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001083", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "功能需求描述"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001084", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "普通用户可从头像下方二级菜单进入“我的用量”，查看本人人民币消耗、可用额度和会话维度消费明细。超级管理员可在“设置 > 用量管理”查看全组织人民币消耗与 Token。用量明细和额度管理合并在同一树形表格中：部门展开到人员，人员下一级直接展示请求，不再额外展开模块、子功能和智能体层级。管理员可对个人设置日、周或月额度，部门行不提供额度操作。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001085", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "Token 与人民币金额采用两阶段更新：请求完成后立即生成实时初算，保证用户能够及时看到本次消耗；次日对前一自然日 Token 统一重算并回写人民币金额。页面展示“初算/已校准”状态及最近更新时间，累计用量、剩余额度和导出结果始终使用当前最新结果。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001086", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "用户角色与用户故事"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001087", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "作为普通用户，我希望了解自己已经消耗多少人民币额度、还剩多少额度，并定位到具体会话。作为超级管理员，我希望掌握全组织费用去向、剩余额度和异常调用，并追溯到单次调用。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001088", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "业务主流程图及说明"]]], ["code", {"syntax": "mermaid", "theme": "default", "uuid": "u00108